WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.340
in the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, Amen."

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:13.620
The reading from the Sinoxadion, from May 29th, on which we commemorate the Holy Virgin

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:23.740
martyr, Thaedosia. In the fifth year of Diocletian's great persecution in 307, a young consecrated

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:31.500
Virgin, barely eighteen years old, called Thaedosia and Cessaria in Palestine, went up on Easter

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:37.700
Sunday to the prisoners who had confessed the name of Christ, and were waiting in chains

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:45.300
to go before the judge, and ask them to remember her when they attained the kingdom of heaven.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:52.940
Soldiers immediately seized the girl and took her before urban the governor. Suddenly, filled

00:00:52.940 --> 00:01:00.460
with rage and fury, he ordered her to offer sacrifice. When she refused, she was cruelly

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:09.540
tortured on her ribs, breasts, and abdomen, the torture revealing her very bones. The saint,

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:17.700
however, suffered in silence, and this supernatural state excited the fury of the magistrate even more.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:25.700
When he exhorted her once more to sacrifice, Thaedosia, giving him a long hard look,

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:29.380
said with a smile her face resplendent.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:38.980
Man, why have you gone so far astray? Do you not know that I am acting in conformity with my prayers,

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:46.660
having been judged worthy to partake in the lot of Christ's martyrs? Seeing that the people were

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:53.220
beginning to mock at him, urban, unable to subdue her with the harshest tortures, ordered that she

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:59.540
be thrown into the sea. Then he turned to the confessors who had been encouraged by the girl's

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:06.900
resistance and condemned them to the implacable copper mines of Faneo. Through the prayers of our

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:12.500
holy fathers, O Lord Jesus Christ our God, have mercy on us and save us.
